ented trainee Sam can receive this lesson.","The represented state has no ground-lesson completion field, so this action does not change flight completion."],"tests":["The instructor can teach Sam when they share a place.","Teaching another person or teaching from a different place is refused."],"semantic_bindings":["trainee is Sam, the recipient of the ground lesson."]},{"schema_version":"world-substrate-action-mechanic/v0","mechanic_id":"inspect-aircraft","version":"1","action_kind":"inspect-helicopter","rationale":"Inspecting the represented helicopter increments its inspection count when the mechanic and helicopter are together.","actor_selector":{"categories":["actor"],"components":["person"]},"participants":{"aircraft":{"categories":["aircraft"],"components":["aircraft"]}},"parameters":{},"checks":[{"label":"the mechanic is inspecting","left":{"participant":{"name":"actor","path":"components.person.role"}},"op":"eq","right":{"literal":"mechanic"}},{"label":"the helicopter is where the mechanic is","left":{"participant":{"name":"actor","path":"location.location_id"}},"op":"eq","right":{"participant":{"name":"aircraft","path":"location.location_id"}}}],"effects":[{"participant":"aircraft","path":"components.aircraft.inspection_count","op":"add","value":{"literal":1}}],"limits":["The inspection count records inspections; it does not represent a separate airworthiness certification."],"tests":["The mechanic can inspect the helicopter when both are in the same place.","Inspection is refused when the mechanic is elsewhere or is not a mechanic."],"semantic_bindings":["aircraft is the helicopter being inspected."]},{"schema_version":"world-substrate-action-mechanic/v0","mechanic_id":"fly-training-lesson","version":"1","action_kind":"fly-training-lesson","rationale":"A training flight requires the instructor, Sam, and helicopter to be together, with fuel and a prior inspection represented; the flight uses fuel and increments Sam’s completed flights.","actor_selector":{