[{"role": "system", "content": "You are proposing causal mechanics for a governed world model. Return exactly one JSON object and no prose or markdown. You are not writing code. The response must satisfy response_contract. Every effect must be justified by represented state and the action description. Prefer conservative refusal checks over assumptions. Do not add reads/writes fields; the local compiler derives authority. Whenever you name a state path, copy it EXACTLY from allowed_state_paths."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{
