[{"role": "system", "content": "You read the recorded events of one finished simulation and say plainly what happened, through a fixed lens. Use only the events given; never invent an event. For each mechanism, say present only when you can cite at least one event_id from the list that shows it, and name the events that show it best (at most eight). Otherwise say missing and give the plain reason (for example: nobody's support ever depended on a condition; no settled item was ever undone). Write for someone who has never seen the simulation: short sentences, the people's names, no ids in the prose. Return only JSON: {"summary": str (two or three sentences on what happened overall), "mechanisms": [{"id": str, "status": "present" | "missing", "event_ids": [str], "explanation": str (one or two sentences), "missing_reason": str (empty when present)}]}."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Lens: How goods moved through the chain
Mechanisms:
- goods-made: Goods made from other goods. Someone turns inputs into a new kind of good (for example logs into boards), using the inputs up.
- goods-handed-on: Goods carried to the next step. Someone moves goods from one place or business to another, where the next step uses them.
- demand-met: Demand reached and met. Finished goods reach the place that wants them and are taken or used there.
- work-waited: Work held up. A step could not go ahead because what it needs had not arrived or had run out, so someone waited or the chain stalled.

People:
- (not recorded)

Events (20, in order):
{"event_id":"r1-e00001","round":1,"by":"instructor","move":"schedule-lesson","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 1 -> 2","said":"Sam needs instruction, and adding a lesson to the queue is the available way to arrange it."}
{"event_id":"r1-e00003","round":1,"by":"mechanic","move":"inspect-helicopter","changed":"entities.helicopter.components.aircraft.inspection_count: 0 -> 1","said":"As the mechanic, checking the aircraft is a practical step before it is used for lessons."}
{"event_id":"r1-e00005","round":1,"by":"sam","move":"schedule-lesson","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 2 -> 3","said":"I want to train and there is already a lesson waiting, so adding a lesson is a direct way to keep my training moving."}
{"event_id":"r1-e00006","round":1,"by":"the world (a rule)","move":"new-waiting-lessons","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 3 -> 4"}
{"event_id":"r2-e00001","round":2,"by":"dispatcher","move":"schedule-lesson","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 4 -> 5","said":"As dispatcher, I should keep lessons available for Sam to take."}
{"event_id":"r2-e00003","round":2,"by":"instructor","move":"schedule-lesson","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 5 -> 6","said":"I can keep arranging lessons for Sam, and the board is the available way to do that."}
{"event_id":"r2-e00005","round":2,"by":"mechanic","move":"inspect-helicopter","changed":"entities.helicopter.components.aircraft.inspection_count: 1 -> 2","said":"With lessons being scheduled, checking the helicopter again is more useful to my mechanic duties than waiting."}
{"event_id":"r2-e00007","round":2,"by":"sam","move":"schedule-lesson","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 6 -> 7","said":"I want to keep lessons available so I can get flight training."}
{"event_id":"r2-e00008","round":2,"by":"the world (a rule)","move":"new-waiting-lessons","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 7 -> 8"}
{"event_id":"r3-e00001","round":3,"by":"dispatcher","move":"schedule-lesson","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 8 -> 9","said":"Scheduling lessons is part of my dispatcher role, and the board currently has lessons waiting."}
{"event_id":"r3-e00003","round":3,"by":"instructor","move":"schedule-lesson","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 9 -> 10","said":"I want to keep lessons available for Sam, so I will add another to the board."}
{"event_id":"r3-e00004","round":3,"by":"the world (a rule)","move":"new-waiting-lessons","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 10 -> 11"}
{"event_id":"r4-e00001","round":4,"by":"dispatcher","move":"schedule-lesson","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 11 -> 12","said":"Scheduling lessons is my available role action, and I have no reason to stop adding them."}
{"event_id":"r4-e00002","round":4,"by":"the world (a rule)","move":"new-waiting-lessons","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 12 -> 13"}
{"event_id":"r5-e00001","round":5,"by":"dispatcher","move":"schedule-lesson","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 13 -> 14","said":"My available action is to schedule a lesson, and I have no stated reason to stop adding lessons."}
{"event_id":"r5-e00002","round":5,"by":"the world (a rule)","move":"new-waiting-lessons","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 14 -> 15"}
{"event_id":"r6-e00001","round":6,"by":"dispatcher","move":"schedule-lesson","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 15 -> 16","said":"As dispatcher, I am continuing to schedule lessons at the airfield."}
{"event_id":"r6-e00002","round":6,"by":"the world (a rule)","move":"new-waiting-lessons","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 16 -> 17"}
{"event_id":"r7-e00001","round":7,"by":"the world (a rule)","move":"new-waiting-lessons","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 17 -> 18"}
{"event_id":"r8-e00001","round":8,"by":"the world (a rule)","move":"new-waiting-lessons","changed":"entities.lesson-board.components.lesson_queue.waiting_lessons: 18 -> 19"}"}]

